    {
      "title": "Conservation",
      "level": 1,
      "path": [
        "Conservation"
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Basselinia pancheri is protected by legislation in Province Nord. B. pancheri occurs in seventeen protected areas: Mont Pani, Parc de la Rivire Bleue, La Dumba, Mont Do, Fort cache, Barrage de Yat, Montagne des sources, Haute Dumba, Fort de Saille, Pic du Pin, Pic du grand Kaori, Massif du Kouakou, Foret Nord, Nodela, Haute Yat, Chutes de la Madeleine, and Valle de la Thy. No seeds are known to have been collected for ex situ storage, but several living collections are known to occur in botanic gardens."
        },
        {
          "type": "style",
          "data": {
            "bold": [],
            "italic": [
              "Basselinia pancheri",
              "B. pancheri",
              "ex situ"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
